{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1940. France is under Nazi occupation. You lead a group of determined resistance fighters, sabotaging enemy plans and reigniting hope in a nation in chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Call of Resistance</i>, immerse yourself in the heart of occupied France, where the war is fought from the shadows. Join a group of five resistance members, each with unique skills, united by their courage and their determination to free their country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through sabotage, espionage, and covert operations, every mission brings you closer to your goal: weaken the enemy and rekindle hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time tactics</strong>: Take control of five resistance fighters with complementary abilities. Infiltrate enemy bases, gather crucial intel, and sabotage Nazi infrastructure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique skills</strong>: Each character has specific abilities, such as distraction, stealth kills, or precision shooting. Combine them to create effective strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/extras/587db53de408b25ba4aefa1b12ee86f1.poster.avif?t=1757614011\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/extras/587db53de408b25ba4aefa1b12ee86f1.webm?t=1757614011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/extras/587db53de408b25ba4aefa1b12ee86f1.mp4?t=1757614011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic historical atmosphere</strong>, faithfully recreating occupied France during World War II.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive tactical gameplay</strong> inspired by genre classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/extras/2885ccc5e84d40c873e3ab457a6cfe25.poster.avif?t=1757614011\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/extras/2885ccc5e84d40c873e3ab457a6cfe25.webm?t=1757614011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/extras/2885ccc5e84d40c873e3ab457a6cfe25.mp4?t=1757614011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gripping narrative</strong> where courage and sacrifice are at the heart of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An emotional soundtrack</strong> that enhances immersion in this tense setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Resistance today and write your own chapter of courage and freedom. If we fail, hope dies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790670?t=1757614011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790670?t=1757614011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/82c3baab9e37ed00b61041df7c605bd06ae9a62a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757614011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790670/82c3baab9e37ed00b61041df7c605bd06ae9a62a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757614011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content